  "term": "PVS",
  "definition": "PVS refers to the Political Violence Support scale, a psychological assessment measure used to evaluate attitudes that endorse or support political violence. In the source packet, it is described as a one-dimensional scale with evidence of reliability and validity in Chilean university students.",
